#: ../../toolscript.md:1
msgid "ToolScript"
msgstr "ToolScript"

#: ../../toolscript.md:3
msgid ""
"`ToolScript` runs a Python script whose `call()` invokes minacode's own "
"tools. It is for the case where the agent would otherwise emit the same "
"call several times over with different arguments: only what the script "
"prints returns to the conversation, so a batch of calls collapses into a "
"single result."
msgstr ""
"`ToolScript` 运行一段 Python 脚本,其中的 `call()` 调用 minacode 自己的工具。它面向的场景是:age"
"nt 否则就要用不同参数把同一个调用发出好几次——只有脚本 print 的内容会回到对话中,于是一批调用坍缩成一个结果。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:8
msgid ""
"It is always available — built-in tools are scriptable on their own, and "
"the MCP entries below additionally need a connected server."
msgstr "它始终可用——内置工具本身就可以脚本化,下面的 MCP 条目则还需要一个已连接的 server。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:11
msgid "When it is worth it"
msgstr "什么时候值得用"

#: ../../toolscript.md:13
msgid ""
"Reach for a script at <span class=\"marker\">four or more same-shape "
"calls whose individual results you do not need</span> — the script keeps "
"them out of the context and returns the summary it prints. Below that, or"
" when each result has to be read, or when a step needs the model's own "
"judgment, plain batching is better: a script runs to the end on its own, "
"with no model in the loop."
msgstr ""
"当出现<span class=\\\"marker\\\">四次及以上形状相同、且不需要逐条结果的调用</span>时,再考虑写脚本——脚本"
"会把它们挡在 context 之外,只返回它 print 的那份汇总。低于这个量,或者每条结果都要读,或者某一步需要模型自己判断时,普通的批"
"量调用更好:脚本会自己一路跑到底,中途没有模型参与。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:19
msgid "Describing shapes in bulk"
msgstr "批量描述形状"

#: ../../toolscript.md:21
msgid ""
"`ToolScript(action=\"describe\", tools=[...])` batch-reports each tool's "
"call shape and a json gate. A list entry is either a built-in tool name "
"like `\"Read\"` or an MCP tool as `\"server.tool\"`:"
msgstr ""
"`ToolScript(action=\\\"describe\\\", tools=[...])` 批量报告每个工具的调用形状与 json"
" gate。列表条目可以是内置工具名(如 `\\\"Read\\\"`),也可以是 `\\\"server.tool\\\"` 形式的 MC"
"P 工具:"

#: ../../toolscript.md:25
msgid ""
"`json: yes` — the server declared an `outputSchema`, so `format=\"json\"`"
" below can rely on it."
msgstr ""
"`json: yes` — server 声明了 `outputSchema`,因此下面的 `format=\\\"json\\\"` 可以"
"依赖它。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:26
msgid ""
"`json: unknown` — no declared schema; `format=\"json\"` will try to parse"
" the returned text and may fail."
msgstr "`json: unknown` — 未声明 schema;`format=\\\"json\\\"` 会尝试解析返回的文本,可能失败。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:28
msgid ""
"`json: no` — built-in tools: scriptable with `format=\"text\"`, but no "
"structured return yet."
msgstr "`json: no` — 内置工具:可用 `format=\\\"text\\\"` 脚本化,但暂无结构化返回。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:30
msgid ""
"The MCP rendering matches `MCP(action=\"describe\")` with the gate line "
"added; built-in entries are compact one-liners with their parameter "
"essentials. Either way, a shape learned here is what a scripted call will"
" actually receive."
msgstr ""
"MCP 部分的渲染与 `MCP(action=\\\"describe\\\")` 完全一致,只多出 gate 那一行;内置条目则是带参数要"
"点的紧凑单行。无论哪种,这里学到的形状就是脚本调用真正会收到的形状。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:34
msgid "Running a script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../toolscript.md:36
msgid ""
"`ToolScript(action=\"call\", code=\"...\")` runs the code as Python. "
"Inside it, `call()` invokes a tool — built-in or MCP:"
msgstr ""
"`ToolScript(action=\\\"call\\\", code=\\\"...\\\")` 以 Python 运行该代码。在其中"
"，`call()` 调用一个工具--内置或 MCP:"

#: ../../toolscript.md:49
msgid ""
"`call(name, args, format=\"text\")` — `name` is a built-in tool like "
"`\"Read\"`, `\"Bash\"`, or `\"Edit\"`, or `\"MCP\"` for a server tool. "
"`Delegate`, `Job`, and `ToolScript` itself cannot be nested. "
"`format=\"text\"` returns the rendered result; MCP calls may use "
"`format=\"json\"` for a parsed dict, while built-ins refuse it until they"
" gain structured results (`<name> does not support format=\"json\"`)."
msgstr ""
"`call(name, args, format=\\\"text\\\")` -- `name` 是内置工具名(如 `\\\"Read\\"
"\"`、`\\\"Bash\\\"`、`\\\"Edit\\\"`),或用 `\\\"MCP\\\"` 表示 server 工具。`Dele"
"gate`、`Job` 以及 `ToolScript` 自身不能嵌套。`format=\\\"text\\\"` 返回渲染后的结果;MCP "
"调用可以用 `format=\\\"json\\\"` 得到解析后的 dict,内置工具在获得结构化返回之前会拒绝它(`<name> doe"
"s not support format=\\\"json\\\">`)。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:54
msgid ""
"Nested calls go through the <span class=\"marker\">same confirmation, "
"live logging, and `tr.N` retention as top-level calls</span>, and they "
"never add extra tool messages — the agent still sees exactly one result "
"per call it emitted."
msgstr ""
"嵌套调用会经过<span class=\\\"marker\\\">与顶层调用相同的确认、实时日志与 `tr.N` 保留</span>,并且"
"从不产生额外的 tool message —— agent 看到的仍然是它发出的每个调用对应一个结果。嵌套调用走与顶层调用<span cla"
"ss=\\\"marker\\\">相同的确认、实时日志与 `tr.N` 保留</span>,并且绝不会产生额外的 tool message"
"——agent 仍然恰好为它发出的每个调用看到一条结果。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:57
msgid ""
"The result envelope lists the nested `tr.N` keys, so a shortened output "
"can still be recalled."
msgstr "结果信封会列出嵌套的 `tr.N` key,因此被截短的输出仍可被 Recall。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:58
msgid ""
"Refusing a nested call aborts the script; the rest of the outer batch "
"continues."
msgstr "拒绝一次嵌套调用会中止脚本;外层批次的其余调用继续执行。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:59
msgid ""
"A script that fails returns with a traceback (source lines included) so "
"the agent can correct itself."
msgstr "失败的脚本会带着 traceback(含出错行源码)返回,以便 agent 自行修正。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:61
msgid ""
"Pure script execution is budgeted at about 60 seconds, excluding time "
"spent inside nested calls."
msgstr "纯脚本执行约有 60 秒的预算,不包括嵌套调用内部耗时。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:64
msgid "The json gate in practice"
msgstr "json gate 的实际行为"

#: ../../toolscript.md:66
msgid ""
"Built-in tools report `json: no` and take `format=\"text\"` only: "
"`format=\"json\"` refuses with `<name> does not support format=\"json\"`."
" For MCP calls, `format=\"json\"` prefers the server's declared "
"`structuredContent`. Two errors are possible:"
msgstr ""
"内置工具报告 `json: no`,且只接受 `format=\\\"text\\\"`:`format=\\\"json\\\"` 会以 "
"`<name> does not support format=\\\"json\\\"` 拒绝。对 MCP 调用,`format=\\\""
"json\\\"` 优先取 server 声明的 `structuredContent`。可能出现两种错误:内置工具标 `json: no`"
",只接受 `format=\\\"text\\\"`:`format=\\\"json\\\"` 会以 `<name> does not s"
"upport format=\\\"json\\\"` 拒绝。对 MCP 调用,`format=\\\"json\\\"` 优先取 serv"
"er 声明的 `structuredContent`。可能有两种错误:"

#: ../../toolscript.md:70
msgid ""
"The tool declared an `outputSchema` but the call returned no "
"`structuredContent` — reported as `server declared outputSchema but no "
"structuredContent`."
msgstr ""
"工具声明了 `outputSchema`,但调用没有返回 `structuredContent` -- 报告为 `server declar"
"ed outputSchema but no structuredContent`。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:72
msgid ""
"No schema was declared and the returned text is not JSON — reported as "
"`MCP returned text that is not JSON`."
msgstr "未声明 schema 且返回的文本不是 JSON — 报告为 `MCP returned text that is not JSON`。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:75
msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全"

#: ../../toolscript.md:77
msgid ""
"The script is <span class=\"marker\">not sandboxed</span>: it runs with "
"the same privileges as `Bash`. `ToolScript` asks for confirmation on "
"every `action=\"call\"` and the prompt shows the opening lines of the "
"script, syntax-highlighted; `--yolo` skips that confirmation exactly as "
"it does for `Bash`."
msgstr ""
"脚本<span class=\\\"marker\\\">不是沙箱</span>:它与 `Bash` 拥有相同权限。`ToolScript`"
" 对每次 `action=\\\"call\\\"` 都会请求确认,提示会展示脚本开头若干行,并带语法高亮;`--yolo` 会像跳过 `B"
"ash` 一样跳过该确认。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:82
msgid "Reading the log"
msgstr "读日志"

#: ../../toolscript.md:84
msgid ""
"A script's calls are logged indented beneath it on a `│` rail that runs "
"unbroken from the script, through every call it made — including whatever"
" each of those logged below itself — down to the result line. The batch "
"therefore reads as work the script did, rather than as calls the model "
"made itself."
msgstr ""
"脚本发起的调用会缩进记录在它下面,并落在一条 `│` 竖线上:这条线从脚本一路不断开地穿过它发起的每一次调用——包括每次调用自己在下方记录的"
"内容——直到结果行为止。于是这一批读起来是脚本做的事,而不是模型自己发起的调用。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:91
msgid ""
"The result line reports how many nested calls ran and the first lines of "
"what the script printed; a script that failed says so there and carries "
"the error."
msgstr "结果行会报告嵌套调用的数量,以及脚本打印内容的开头几行;脚本失败时会在那里写明,并带上错误。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:94
msgid "Reading the script"
msgstr "查看脚本"

#: ../../toolscript.md:96
msgid ""
"The log shows a bounded excerpt of the script, not all of it — a long "
"script would bury everything it then goes on to do. The whole body is one"
" keypress away:"
msgstr "日志只展示脚本的有限摘录,而不是全文 —— 长脚本会把它随后做的一切都淹没。完整脚本只差一次按键:"

#: ../../toolscript.md:99
msgid ""
"**`v` at the confirmation prompt** opens a read-only, scrolling viewer "
"with the complete script, numbered and highlighted. `Esc`/`q` returns to "
"the prompt; nothing is approved by viewing."
msgstr ""
"**在确认提示处按 `v`** 会打开只读、可滚动的查看器,展示带行号与高亮的完整脚本。`Esc`/`q` 回到提示;查看本身不会批准任何东"
"西。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:101
msgid ""
"**`Ctrl-O` afterwards** lists recent `Bash` and `ToolScript` calls; "
"selecting a script opens the same viewer, with the result it returned "
"below the source — the printed output, or the whole traceback when the "
"script failed. This is how a script is read under `--yolo`, where no "
"prompt ever stops to offer `v`. A very large result is bounded there "
"(head and tail, long lines clipped) and the header says when it was."
msgstr ""
"**事后按 `Ctrl-O`** 会列出最近的 `Bash` 与 `ToolScript` 调用;选中一个脚本即可打开同一个查看器,并在源码"
"下方显示它返回的结果--print 的输出,或者脚本失败时的完整 traceback。在 `--yolo` 下就是这样读脚本的,因为那里没有"
"任何提示会停下来提供 `v`。超大的结果在那里会被限制(保留头尾、截断超长行),发生时头部会写明。"

#: ../../toolscript.md:107
msgid ""
"Line numbers in the viewer match the ones in a failed script's traceback "
"(`File \"<toolscript>\", line N`)."
msgstr "查看器中的行号与脚本失败时 traceback 里的行号一致(`File \"<toolscript>\", line N`)。"
